{"code":0,"data":{"job_post_detail":{"id":"7671128909705922843","title":"嵌入式软件开发工程师","description":"1. 负责嵌入式系统的软件设计、开发、调试与维护\n2. 参与产品需求分析，制定软件架构及模块设计方案\n3. 编写底层驱动程序，实现与硬件的交互\n4. 开发基于RTOS（如FreeRTOS、uC/OS等）或裸机的应用程序\n5. 配合硬件工程师完成系统联调、性能优化和问题排查\n6. 编写相关技术文档，包括设计文档、测试文档等\n7. 跟踪新技术发展，持续提升系统性能与稳定性","requirement":"1. 本科及以上学历，电子工程、自动化、计算机科学、通信工程等相关专业\n2. 掌握嵌入式软件开发流程，驱动程序移植、镜像编译、应用程序开发\n3. 熟练掌握C语言编程，了解音频相关项目者优先\n4. 熟悉主流嵌入式平台（如ARM Cortex-M系列、STM32、TI DSP、ESP32等）\n5. 熟悉常用接口协议开发（如SPI、I2C、UART、CAN、USB等）\n6. 有RTOS（FreeRTOS、ThreadX、RT-Thread等）开发经验者优先\n7. 有物联网（IoT）、工业控制、智能硬件、车载系统等领域经验者优先","city_info":{"code":"CT_11","name":"北京","en_name":"Beijing","i18n_name":"北京"},"recruit_type":{"id":"201","name":"正式","en_name":"Regular","i18n_name":"正式","depth":2,"parent":{"id":"2","name":"校招","en_name":"Campus","i18n_name":"校招","depth":1,"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"publish_time":1786073942287,"channel_online_status":1,"job_subject":{"id":"7659311908839262514","name":{"zh_cn":"2027届校园招聘计划","i18n":"2027届校园招聘计划"},"limit_count":2,"active_status":1},"job_function":{"id":"7178759516879405165","name":"软件研发类","en_name":"Software R\u0026D","i18n_name":"软件研发类"},"job_id":"7671127950721763634","city_list":[{"code":"CT_11","name":"北京","en_name":"Beijing","location_type":3,"i18n_name":"北京","py_name":"beijing","mdm_code":"MDCY00000001","node_status":1}],"job_post_info":{"recruitment_type":{"id":"201","name":"正式","en_name":"Regular","i18n_name":"正式","depth":2,"parent":{"id":"2","name":"校招","en_name":"Campus","i18n_name":"校招","depth":1,"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"HighlightList":[],"JobChannelPublishList":[],"job_post_object_value_map":{},"address_list":[],"city_list":[],"correlation_job_list":[],"tag_list":[],"storefront_list":[],"target_major_list":[],"job_post_process_time_list":[],"job_level_id_list":[]},"city_info_list_for_delivery":[{"code":"CT_11","name":"北京"